{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HELLO"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月31日大晦日ですねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長いようで凄くあっという間の１年でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれも本当に濃い１年で、卒業して新しい道、夢に向かっていったメンバーや、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２期生という新しい仲間も増えて、色々な進化があり、沢山成長することも出来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代々木第一体育館や、日本武道館でliveをしたり、\n舞台でプリンシパルをしたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣いたり笑ったり...めまぐるしい日々を送り、\n色々なことがありすぎて肉体的にも精神的にも辛くて、\n心がついていけず苦しんだこともありました...\n自分を見失いそうになったときもありました...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも大好きなメンバー！\n家族や友達、 私達の為に一生懸命頑張って下さるスタッフさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして私達が頑張れるのは大切な大切な皆様がいたから\nここまでこれたと思ってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の思い出には全部皆さんがいます！\nそれってすごく幸せだなって思うのっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆に出会えて本当に良かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有り難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなにきつい坂道でも皆となら乗り越えられる気がする......\nこれからも全力で頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばいよこの１年振り返りながらブログかいてると涙溢れてきた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯の画面がぼやけて見えないからこのへんで終わろうかなっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年も宜しくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きだよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良いお年を......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/31/9664527/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}